  <ThingDef ParentName="BenchBase">
    <defName>CVG_RuneTable</defName>
    <label>rune table</label>
    <description>A slab of jade carved with formation lines. During the Iron Calamity the sects of Jiuxiao learned that mortal steel could not bite the devouring machine, so they etched runes on every blade their servants carried; the habit outlived the war. Engraves runes on an ordinary weapon, raising it to spirit grade 1 so it can wound cultivators.</description>
