  <ThingDef ParentName="BenchBase">
    <defName>CVG_TalismanTable</defName>
    <label>talisman table</label>
    <description>A desk of brushes, cinnabar ink and yellow paper. Tradition holds that Zhang Daoling, the first Celestial Master, received the art of talismans on Longhushan, the Dragon and Tiger Mountain, and that each one must be written in a single breath of qi or it is only ink. Writes single-use talismans.</description>
